{"servicesList":[{"slug":"earthquake-resistant-structure","name":"Earthquake Resistant Construction","image":"/images/prefab-house.jpg","summary":"Lightweight wall panel and steel frame systems engineered to absorb seismic shocks and minimize structural deflection.","content":"Our earthquake-resistant structural solutions feature lightweight Smart Panels interlocking directly with precision-engineered steel frames. By reducing the overall building weight by over 60% compared to traditional brick masonry, base shear forces during an earthquake are dramatically decreased. Every installation conforms to the Nepal National Building Code for active seismic zones."},{"slug":"smart-sandwich-panel-solutions","name":"Smart Sandwich Panel Installation","image":"/images/sandwich-panel.jpg","summary":"Tongue-and-groove EPS core panels with 4.5mm calcium silicate boards for walls, partitions, and exterior envelopes.","content":"Smart Sandwich Panels combine an EPS-and-cement core wrapped in 4.5mm calcium silicate board on both faces. Featuring tongue-and-groove interlocking edges, every panel locks tightly into the next for fast on-site installation, clean finish, and exceptional thermal and sound barrier performance."},{"slug":"smart-solid-panel-construction","name":"Smart Solid Panel Wall Systems","image":"/uploads/slides/1788705701616-images__4_.jpg","summary":"Mesh-reinforced solid panels plastered after installation for heavy-duty structural durability and impact resistance.","content":"Smart Solid Panels are manufactured from expanded polystyrene beads, cement, sand, water, and specialized bonding agents, reinforced with internal mesh for added tensile strength. Ideal for high-traffic buildings, schools, and commercial facilities requiring a traditional plastered aesthetic with prefab speed."},{"slug":"prefab-house","name":"Turnkey Prefab Residential & Commercial Homes","image":"/uploads/slides/1788705675548-photo-1570129477492-45c003edd2be.avif","summary":"Complete prefabricated residential homes and commercial buildings constructed in 7 to 15 days.","content":"We manufacture and assemble complete turnkey prefab houses using Smart Panels. From architectural blueprints and foundation design to panel erection, roofing, and finishing, our turnkey solution delivers safe, earthquake-ready homes in a fraction of traditional construction time."},{"slug":"smart-eps-blocks","name":"Smart EPS Construction Blocks","image":"/uploads/slides/1788705567899-138000974030903._Lucias_Garden_photo_300dpi_w1728.avif","summary":"Ultra-lightweight OPC cement & EPS molded blocks for partition walls, floor infills, and insulation layers.","content":"Lightweight construction blocks made from EPS beads, OPC cement, water, and essential additives, molded into precise dimensions (100×200×600mm, 150×200×600mm, 200×200×600mm). Superior thermal insulation and easy handling on construction sites without heavy machinery."},{"slug":"wall-roof-solutions","name":"Wall & Roof Insulation Systems","image":"/images/korean-house.jpg","summary":"Complete insulated wall cladding and roofing systems tailored for schools, hospitals, resorts, and commercial complexes.","content":"We supply and install complete building envelopes, including insulated sandwich wall systems, fire-rated ceiling panels, and temperature-controlled roof cladding designed to withstand harsh monsoon rains and winter cold across Nepal."}]}